==Description==
The '''Valentines 2026 Crate''' is an event [[Crates|crate]]. It has fifteen skins in total. It was released to coincide with Valentine's Day 2026. Nine of the skins return from previous Valentine's Day crates, while six are new.

The '''Valentines 2026 Crate''' is a gold, pink and white heart-shaped case with heart decorations. A heart-shaped lock can be found at the top of the chest, which is used to open the crate with a stylized golden red heart key.

